## Notice on Factorio assets

The MIT license above applies only to material owned by the author of this
repository: the Lua source of the mods, the TypeScript tooling, and any
graphics, sounds and locale files created by the author.

It does **not** apply to assets of Factorio or to works derived from them.
Under the Factorio Terms of Service (https://factorio.com/terms-of-service):

- Adaptations and works derived from Factorio assets may be included in and
  distributed as part of a mod, but Wube Software Ltd. retains all rights and
  license to those assets and to the works derived from them, and reserves the
  right to request their removal.
- Distribution of original Factorio art assets is not permitted beyond what is
  necessary to create one's own mods.
- Any commercial use of Factorio source code or art assets requires the
  express consent of Wube Software Ltd.

Factorio is a trademark of Wube Software Ltd. This repository is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sanctioned by Wube Software Ltd.

